DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The llcc device driver supports DEC EtherWORKS III Ethernet interfaces,
     which are based on the LEMAC Ethernet chip.  This includes the DE203,
     DE204, and DE205.

MMEEDDIIAA SSEELLEECCTTIIOONN
     The EtherWORKS III series supports various combinations of media, depend‐
     ing on model.  Some models also support media autoselect.  Media is se‐
     lected with ifconfig(8)'s ‘media’ directive.

